ry of a Star lets you partake in the life and death of a solitary star. What will happen within this small part of the infinity that is space. Will there be life? Will there be peace? Or war?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock the different stories being told, and watch the star reach its ultimate fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>The Story of a Sea</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277060/extras/storysea.png?t=1738292696\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Story of a Sea is an experience. Partake in the life of this piece of the world, decide the direction it will take, and uncover the secrets. Enjoy a meditative puzzle, and try to relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Story of a Sea continues the format set by its predecessors, <i>The Story of a World</i> and The <i>Story of a Star</i>, with the same of meditative experience. The object of the game is to find the 20 different endings. Watch the sea, life, sky, moon, and land evolve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["M\u00e5rten Jonsson","JMJ Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277060/header.jpg?t=1738292696","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2024, JMJ Interactive","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257061997,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257061997/movie480.mp4?t=1729198779","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257061997/movi